      "lesson_pounce": "Mom is sneaking up on a hare. Creep closer and tap Pounce!",
      "lesson_shelter": "Back to the den! Follow Mom inside.",
      "lesson_sleep": "Time for a nap. Curl up in the den and tap Sleep.",
